sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Cliente Web
    participant G as Gateway (HTTPS)
    participant B as bff-web
    participant P as payments-service
    participant A as accounts-service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant N as notification-service
    U->>G: POST /web/transfers (JWT scope web+bank.write)
    G->>G: valida firma JWT y scope
    G->>B: reenvia (lb://bff-web)
    B->>P: POST /payments/transfers + Idempotency-Key + JWT
    P->>P: guarda Operacion PENDIENTE (id = Idempotency-Key)
    P->>A: DEBITO origen (operacionId KEY:DB)
    A->>A: SELECT FOR UPDATE, valida saldo, registra operacion
    A-->>P: 200 saldoResultante
    P->>A: CREDITO destino (KEY:CR)
    alt destino OK
        A-->>P: 200
        P->>P: movimientos + Operacion COMPLETADA
        P--)K: transactions.completed
        K--)N: notificacion PUSH
        P-->>B: 201 COMPLETADA
    else destino falla (cerrada / caida)
        A-->>P: 409 / error
        P->>A: COMPENSACION: CREDITO origen (KEY:RV)
        P->>P: Operacion REVERTIDA
        P-->>B: 409/503 REVERTIDA
    end
    B-->>U: respuesta
